<!doctype html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Yuz o'lchovi — PSL tahlil</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#eef1f4;--ink:#17202a;--mute:#5b6773;--line:#c9d1d9;--acc:#1f5eff;--card:#fff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 18px 56px}
h1{font:600 30px/1.15 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sub{color:var(--mute);margin:0 0 22px;max-width:46ch}
.drop{display:block;border:2px dashed var(--acc);border-radius:6px;padding:22px 16px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card);font-weight:600;color:var(--acc)}
.drop:focus-within,.drop:hover{background:#e6edff}
.drop small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--mute);margin-top:4px}
#status{min-height:1.5em;color:var(--mute);margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14px}
#out{margin-top:20px}
.stage{background:#000;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;line-height:0}
canvas{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:70vh;object-fit:contain}
.score{margin:26px 0 8px}
.num{font:600 64px/1 Georgia,serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.num span{font:400 18px system-ui;color:var(--mute);margin-left:6px}
.tier{font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 14px}
.ruler{position:relative;height:34px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin-top:8px}
.ruler i{position:absolute;top:0;width:1px;height:10px;background:var(--ink)}
.ruler i:nth-child(odd){height:16px}
.ruler b{position:absolute;top:-2px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:0;height:0;border:8px solid transparent;border-top:14px solid var(--acc);border-bottom:0;transition:left .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.ticks{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:-14px;padding:0 0}
.ticks{margin-top:18px}
#warn{background:#fff4d6;border-left:4px solid #c98a00;padding:10px 12px;margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}
ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:22px 0 0}
li{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.r{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
.r em{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.ideal{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}
.bar{height:6px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}
.bar u{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--acc);border-radius:3px}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:22px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ruler b{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Yuzingizni raqamlar bilan o'lchang</h1>
<p class="sub">Rasm qurilmangizdan chiqmaydi: tahlil to'liq brauzerning o'zida bajariladi. Natija ko'ngilochar, ilmiy emas.</p>
<label class="drop" for="f">Rasm tanlang yoki selfi oling
<small>Old tomondan, neytral yuz, tekis yorug'lik, sochlar peshonani yopmasin</small>
<input id="f" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden>
</label>
<p id="status" role="status"></p>
<section id="out" hidden>
<div class="stage"><canvas id="c"></canvas></div>
<div class="score">
<div class="num"><span id="big"></span></div>
<div class="tier" id="tier"></div>
<div class="ruler" id="ruler"><b id="mark" style="left:0"></b></div>
<div class="ticks"><span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span></div>
</div>
<p id="warn" hidden></p>
<ul id="rows"></ul>
